1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,770
The comparison to learn.

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:10,299
Linkage keeps genes together and gives parental combinations; it weakens with distance; it keeps good combinations intact.

3
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:18,424
Crossing over separates them and gives recombinants; it becomes more frequent with distance; and it creates variation.

